Subject: [PATCH 0/2] Add initial support for Samsung Galaxy Note9 (crownlte)

This adds an initial device tree for the Exynos 9810 based Samsung Galaxy
Note9 (SM-N960F), a sibling of the already supported Galaxy S9 (starlte):
simple-framebuffer, hardware keys, RAM below 4 GiB and the memory regions
used by the stock bootloader and firmware.

NOT TESTED ON HARDWARE YET. Not for submission in this state.

Tool use (Documentation/process/generated-content.rst): both patches were
written by an AI coding agent (Claude Opus 5.5, Anthropic) from the
downstream LineageOS kernel (android_kernel_samsung_universal9810,
lineage-17.1, 5a2dd7d6f3a0) and the upstream starlte DTS, and checked with
dtc W=1, dtbs_check and checkpatch --strict.

